  "footer": "This plan is a starting point built from impact ratings and your answers, not a prescription. Effects on sperm show up after about 2–3 months (one spermatogenic cycle) and on eggs after about 3 months (folliculogenesis), so start early. Check any supplement with a clinician, especially when trying to conceive. For a month-by-month plan covering both partners, read the \"Couple's 3-month plan\" in the IVF add-ons deep dive."
